en_Name=Hakon <Quest>
en_Desc=Christmas Eve has fallen on Eleusis, but something is not right... Creatures of the cold have come out of the forests and mountains, stealing the sacred Christmas cookies.
pt_Name=Hakon <Missão>
pt_Desc=A véspera de Natal chegou a Elêusis, mas algo está errado... Criaturas do frio saíram das florestas e montanhas, roubando os sagrados biscoitos de Natal.
fr_Name=Hakon <Quête>
fr_Desc=La veille de Noël est arrivée à Éleusis, mais quelque chose cloche… Des créatures du froid sont sorties des forêts et des montagnes, volant les précieux biscuits de Noël.
